  "question": {
    "text": "A $90 \\mathrm{~kg}$ body placed at $2 \\mathrm{R}$ distance from surface of earth experiences gravitational pull of : $\\text { ( } \\mathrm{R}=\\text { Radius of earth, } \\mathrm{g}=10 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-2} \\text { ) }$",
