  "solution": {
    "text": "Here $g_s=$ gravitational acceleration at surface\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {Value of } g=g_5\\left(1+\\frac{h}{R}\\right)^{-2} \\\\\n& =g_5(1+2)^{-2}=\\frac{g_5}{9}\n\\end{aligned}$<br />$\\text {Force }=\\mathrm{mg}=90 \\times \\frac{\\mathrm{g}_5}{9}=100 \\mathrm{~N}$",
